@host = http://localhost:5080
@accountId = acc-1001
@statementId = replace-me

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Upload a statement (multipart)
POST {{host}}/api/statements
X-Correlation-ID: local-dev-001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----StatementVault
------StatementVault
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="accountId"

{{accountId}}
------StatementVault
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="periodStart"

2026-01-01
------StatementVault
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="periodEnd"

2026-01-31
------StatementVault
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="jan-2026.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./jan-2026.pdf
------StatementVault--

### List statements for an account
GET {{host}}/api/statements/{{accountId}}?limit=25

### Get statement metadata
GET {{host}}/api/statements/{{accountId}}/{{statementId}}

### Download statement bytes
GET {{host}}/api/statements/{{accountId}}/{{statementId}}/content

### Presigned URL
GET {{host}}/api/statements/{{accountId}}/{{statementId}}/content?mode=url
